  "reference": "Omobaro 26",
  "copyright": "© 2021 KENBS",
  "verseCount": 65,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "26",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "NUM 26"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "26",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omobaro Okabere Kw’Abaisraeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekaba magega amaakwa aria gaetire, Omonene agakwana na Musa na Eleazari, omomura o Aroni Omokuani, akabateebia,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mobare omoganda bwonsi bw’Abaisraeli, eamate ase eamate. Moriike, abanto bakoorire emiaka emerongo ebere na goetania, abwo baranyare korwana esegi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Musa na Eleazari Omokuani bagakwana n’abanto baria ase enyancha enyomo ya Moabu, ase orooche rwa Yorodani, kororia Yeriko, akabateebia,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Riika abanto bonsi abakoorire emiaka emerongo ebere na goetania, buna Omonene achiigete Musa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abaisraeli abwo barwete ense ya Misiri nabwo aba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rubeni nere orenge omomura omotangi o Israeli. Ase egesaku kiaye nigo chiarenge chiamate echi: Abahanoki, abarwete ase Hanoki, na Abapalu, abarwete ase Palu,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Abahezironi, abarwete ase Hezironi, na Abakarimi, abarwete ase Karimi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Echi nachio chiamate chi’egesaku kia Rubeni. Abaabaretwe nigo barenge chilifu emerongo ene na isato, na amagana atano abere, na merongo etato (43,730).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ororeria rwa Palu n’Eliabu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "amo nabana baye: Nemweli, na Datani, na Abiiramu. (Aba nabwo Datani na Abiiramu bachoretwe korwa ase omoganda. Barabwo bakaamererania na Musa na Aroni, bakaba ase ekeombe gia Kora, ekero baamereranetie n’Omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Riroba rikabwereka rikabamera amo na Kora, ekero omorero osambete na gosiria abanto amagana abere, na merongo etano. Ayio akaba ekiorokererio ki’ogokuurera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende abana ba Kora barabwo tibaitetwe.)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase egesaku gia Simioni nigo chiarenge chiamate echi: Abaanemweli, abarwete ase Nemweli, na Abayamini, abarwete ase Yamini, na Abayakini, abarwete ase Yakini,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Abazera, abarwete ase Zera, na Abasauli, abarwete ase Saulo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Echi nachio chiamate chi’egesaku gia Simioni. Abaabaretwe nigo barenge chilifu emerongo ebere na ibere, na amagana abere (22,200).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase egesaku kia Gadi nigo chiarenge chiamate echi: Abazefoni, abarwete ase Zefoni, na Abahagi, abarwete ase Hagi, na",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abasuni, abarwete ase Suni, na Abaosini, abarwete ase Osini, na Abaeri, abarwete ase Eri,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Abaarodi, abarwete ase Arodi, na Abaareli, abarwete ase Areli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Echi nachio chiamate chi’egesaku kia Gadi. Abaabaretwe nigo barenge chilifi emerongo ene, na amagana atano (40,500).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basinto ba Yuda, Eri na Onani, bagakwera agwo ase ense ya Kaanani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase egesaku kia Yuda nigo chiarenge chiamate echi: Abasela, abarwete ase Sela, na Abaperisi, abarwete ase Peresi, na Abazera, abarwete ase Zera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chiamate chia Peresi nigo chiarenge: Abahezironi, abarwete ase Hezironi, na Abahamuli, abarwete ase Hamuli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Echi nachio chiamate chi’egesaku kia Yuda. Abaabaretwe nigo barenge chilifu emerongo etano ebere na isano nemo, na amagana atano (76,500).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase egesaku gia Isakaru nigo chiarenge chiamate echi: Abatola, abarwete ase Tola, na Abapua, abarwete ase Pua,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Abayasubu, abarwete ase Yasubu, na Abashimuroni, abarwete ase Shimuroni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Echi nachio chiamate chi’egesaku gia Isakaru. Abaabaretwe nigo barenge chilifu emerongo etano nomo na inye, n’amagana atato (64,300).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase egesaku gia Sabuloni nigo chiarenge chiamate echi: Abaseredi, abarwete ase Seredi, na Abaeloni, abarwete ase Eloni, na Abayaleeli, abarwete ase Yaleeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Echi nachio chiamate chi’egesaku gia Sabuloni. Abaabaretwe nigo barenge chilifu emerongo etano nomo na amagana atano (60,500).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebisaku bia Yusufu nebi’abamura baye babere, Manase na Efraimu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase egesaku kia Manase nao eamate ya Makiri yarwete. Makiri nere orenge ise Gileadi, na korwa ase are nao Abagileadi barwete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ororeria rwa Gileadi nigo chiarenge chiamate echi: Abaieseri, abarwete ase Ieseri, na Abaheleki, abarwete ase Heleki,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaasirieli, abarwete ase Asirieli, na Abasekemu, abarwete ase Sekemu,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Abasemida, abarwete ase Semida, na Abaheferi, abarwete ase Heferi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Selofehadi, mosinto o Heferi, tabwate abana abamura, korende nabana abaiseke boka abwate, na amarieta y’abaiseke abwo naro aya: Mala, na Nuhu, na Hogila, na Milka, na Tirisa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Echi nachio chiarenge chiamate chi’egesaku kia Manase. Abaabaretwe nigo barenge chilifu emerongo etano na ibere, na amagana atano abere (52,700).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase egesaku gi’Efraimu nigo chiarenge chiamate echi: Abasutela, abarwete ase Sutela, na Ababeekeri, abarwete ase Bekeri, na Abatahani, abarwete ase Tahani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sutela nigo arenge ise Erani, na korwa ase are nao Abaerani barwete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Echi nachio chiamate chi’egesaku gia Efraimu. Abaabaretwe nigo barenge chilifu emerongo etato na ibere, na amagana atano (32,500).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aba nabwo barenge abana ba Yusufu ne chiamate chiabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase egesaku gia Benjamini nigo chiarenge chiamate echi: Ababela, abarwete ase Bela, na Abaasibeli, abarwete ase Asibeli, na Abaahiramu, abarwete ase Ahiramu,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Abasefufamu, abarwete ase Sefufamu, na Abahufamu, abarwete ase Hufamu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abamura ba Bela nabwo Aridi na Naamani. Korwa ase Aridi nao Abaaridi barwete, na korwa ase Naamani nao Abanaamani barwete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Echi nachio chiarenge chiamate chi’egesaku gia Benjamini Abaabaretwe nigo barenge chilifu emerongo ene na isano, na amagana atano na rimo (45,600).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.41"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase egesaku gia Dani nigo chiarenge chiamate chi’Abasuhamu, abarwete ase Suhamu. Aba nabwo abanto b’egesaku gia Dani ase chiamate chiabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abarwete ase chiamate chi’Abasuhamu nigo barenge chilifu emerongo etano nomo na inye, na amagana ane (64,400).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase egesaku gi’Aseri nigo chiarenge chiamate echi: Abaimuna, abarwete ase Imuna, na Abaisibi, abarwete ase Isibi, na Ababeria, abarwete ase Beria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abamura ba Beria nabwo Heberi ase eamate y’Abaheberi yarwete, na Malikieli, ase eamate y’Abamalikieli yarwete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwana omoiseke o Aseri nigo arenge korokwa Sera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Echi nachio chiamate chi’egesaku gi’Aseri. Abaabaretwe nigo barenge chilifu emerongo etano na isato, na amagana ane (53,400).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.47"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase egesaku kia Nafutali nigo chiarenge chiamate echi: Abayaseli, abarwete ase Yaseli, na Abaguni, abarwete ase Guni,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Abayeseri, abarwete ase Yeseri, na Abasilemu, abarwete ase Silemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Echi nachio chiamate chi’egesaku kia Nafutali. Abaabaretwe nigo barenge chilifu emerongo ene na isano, na amagana ane (45,400).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.50"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto bonsi b’Abaisraeli abarigetwe nigo barenge chilifu amagana atano nomo na eyemo, na amagana atano abere na merongo etato (601,730).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.51"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene agateebia Musa,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aatananere abanto aba chingongo chibe emiando yabo. Ochiatanane kobwatekana nomobaro bw’ abanto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Egesaku kere ekenene keegwe orogongo oronene robe omwando obo, na egesaku kere egeke keegwe orogongo oroke robe omwando obo. Kera egesaku nakeegwe omwando oye koreng’ana nomobaro obo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ense yaatananwe ase ogoakerwa obomera. Abanto mbanyore omwando koreng’ana nomobaro bw’amarieta ’ebisaku bie chisokoro chiabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.55"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "56",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:56"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "56",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Koreng’ana buna obomera boragwere abanto ba kera egesaku, ekenene gose egeke, nabo baranyore omwando obo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.56",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.56"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "57",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:57"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "57",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase egesaku kia Lawi nigo chiarenge chiamate echi: Abagerisoni, abarwete ase Gerisoni, na Abakohati, abarwete ase Kohati, na Abamerari, abarwete ase Merari.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.57",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.57"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "58",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:58"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "58",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Echi nachio chiamate chi’egesaku kia Lawi: Eamate y’Abalibini, na ey’Abaheburoni, na ey’Abamali na ey’Abamusi, na ey’Abakora. Kohati nere orenge ise Amuramu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.58",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.58"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "59",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:59"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "59",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moka Amuramu nigo arenge korokwa Yokebedi, mosubati o Lawi, oria oiboreretwe Lawi agwo ase ense ya Misiri. Omokungu oria akamoiborera Amuramu abana aba: Aroni, na Musa, na Miriamu, omoiseke omwabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.59",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.59"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "60",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:60"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "60",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basinto ba Aroni nabwo aba: Nadabu, na Abihu, na Eleazari, na Itamari.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.60",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.60"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "61",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:61"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "61",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende Nadabu na Abihu bagakwa ekero baruete ogosambwa kw’engeencho eng’ao otachiikiri ase obosio bw’Omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.61",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.61"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "62",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:62"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "62",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kera omonto omosacha ase egati yabo oyo konya okoorire omotienyi oyomo na goetania nigo abaretwe. Barabwo nigo barenge chilifu emerongo ebere na isato (23,000). Abanto aba tibaabaretwe amo n’Abaisraeli bande, ekiagera tibaetwe omwando ase egati y’Abaisraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.62",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.62"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "63",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:63"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "63",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto aba nabwo Musa na Eleazari Omokuani bariigete ekero baabarete Abaisraeli agwo ase enyancha enyomo ya Moabu, ase Yorodani kororia Yeriko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.63",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.63"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "64",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:64"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "64",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende ase egati y’ abanto aba onde tarengeo, nonya noyomo, ase baria Musa na Aroni Omokuani baabarete agwo ase erooro ya Sinai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.64",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.64"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "65",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:65"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "65",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene nakwanete igoro y’abwo, “Barabwo nigo barakwere ase erooro.” Omonto onde tagotigara ore moyo nonya noyomo, otatiga Kalebu, mosinto o Yefune, na Yoshua, mosinto o Nuni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.65",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.65"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
